OL,3,GNEWSAWarning for delays after fog
OL,4,Adisrupts some flights
OL,5,
OL,6,FA number of flights in the West of
OL,7,FEngland have been cancelled or delayed
OL,8,Fdue to foggy weather conditions.
OL,10,FA Bristol Airport spokesperson said
OL,11,Fthree flights were diverted and one
OL,12,Freturned to Dublin because of thick
OL,13,Ffog. Live flight information suggested
OL,14,F14% of flights were delayed.
OL,16,FPassengers due to travel are being
OL,17,Fadvised to check directly with airlines
OL,18,Ffor information before leaving home.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
