OL,3,GNEWSAWarning for delays after fog
OL,4,Adisrupts some flights
OL,5,
OL,6,FA yellow fog warning issued by the Met
OL,7,FOffice was in place until 11:00 GMT,
OL,8,Fwhich urged travellers to be aware of
OL,9,Fthe potential for difficult travel
OL,10,Fconditions and possible delays. It said
OL,11,Fthe fog would be "thinning slowly"
OL,12,Flater in the morning.
